  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hello!\n\nPhysSound creator deemed the plugin deprecated and removed it from the asset store, preventing any purchase… But he got convinced to open-source it for VRChat world creators! \n\nAs of right now it works fine, but VRChat’s version (2.5.1) is lacking two new features that this 2.6.0 has:\n-An “Object Scale Modifier” that’ll affect the pitch and volume depending on the size of the object\n-An “Hits trigger” Boolean that’ll trigger the sound if it passes through a trigger\nThose two features (especially the latter one!) would be incredibly helpful to world creators and the open source element should really be emphasized so more people can add this asset to their world, it really makes a big difference.\n\nHere’s the forum post https://forum.unity.com/threads/deprecated-physsound-physics-audio-system.334297/page-2#post-4399633\nAnd the asset download link https://drive.google.com/file/d/1FgDBXORcDLm9XHQP7Kdc9gFiQZas-M6t\n\nThank you!",
